					<div class="title">
						<h3 class="headline">
															<a href="https://www.nobelprize.org/all-nobel-prizes-2026/">
									<p>Nobel Prizes 2026</p>
								</a>
													</h3>
					</div>
				</header>

				
									<div class="text">
						<p>Six prizes were awarded for achievements that have conferred the greatest benefit to humankind. The 10 laureates' work and discoveries range from optogenetics to efforts to promote peace and international law.</p>
<p>See them all presented here.</p>
					</div>
				
